### 7. `integration-tests/test-helper.ts:323-326` — Stdin write has no backpressure/error handling
```typescript
if (options.stdin) {
  child.stdin!.write(options.stdin);
  child.stdin!.end();
}
```
If the child process exits before consuming stdin, `write()` throws `ERR_STREAM_WRITE_AFTER_END` or `EPIPE` — unhandled, crashes the test.
